{"p":{"slug":"shannon-falcone","first":"Shannon","last":"Falcone","cc":"ANT","iso":"ag","country":"Antigua And Barbuda","g":0,"img":"https://platform.worldofsailors.com/storage/uploads/2026/03/10-shannone-falcone2-1772390489.webp","club":"Antigua Sailing Club","clubs":["Antigua Sailing Club"],"cm":196,"kg":105,"bio":"Shannon Falcone was just three years old when he sailed with his parents across the Atlantic to Antigua. Inheriting his father’s passion, Shannon competed at three Star World Championships with Carlo before sailing in his first America’s Cup in New Zealand with Mascalzone Latino when 20yrs old. In 2010, Shannon was victorious with Oracle Team USA winning his first America’s Cup in a Deed of Gift match and in 2013 was onboard for the greatest comeback in sporting history to defend the Auld Mug in San Francisco. Offshore, two editions of the Volvo Ocean Race and record runs with Comanche deepened Shannon’s all-round experience. He has been back with Luna Rossa Challenge since 2014 and was part of the Prada Cup winning AC75 team for his 6th campaign.","soc":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/racingsf","facebook":"https://facebook.com/RacingSF","x":"https://x.com/racingsf"},"rk":{"c":[4923,167.33,3823,"2026-11-24",[42,"2021-03-09"]]},"st":{"ev":9,"win":4,"pod":5,"avg":18.6,"best":1},"cls":["TP52","AC Class","SSL 47"],"ach2":[["Louis Vuitton Cup winner","silver",1]],"recn":2},"res":{"s":[],"c":[["2026-11-15","Pan American Qualifiers - SSL Gold Cup 2026","Rio de Janeiro","BRA","SSL 47","International",3,12,167.3,5],["2023-12-03","SSL Gold Cup 2023","Las Palmas de Gran Canaria","ESP","SSL 47","Major",26,38,0,1],["2022-05-22","SSL Gold Cup Qualifying Series -Round 1 (Fleet 1)","Grandson","SUI","SSL 47","International",1,4,0,5],["2021-02-21","Prada Cup","Auckland","NZL","AC Class","World",1,3,0,1],["2018-09-22","52 SUPER SERIES Valencia Sailing Week","Valencia","ESP","TP52","International",1,11,0,8],["2018-08-25","Puerto Portals 52 SUPER SERIES Sailing Week